  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h3 data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"139\" id=\"isPasted\">• Brand Introduction:</h3><p data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"446\"><strong data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"159\">Generous Family</strong> exists to help families raise kids who live with open hands and hearts. We create tools and resources that make generosity fun, practical, and deeply rooted in faith and character. Our book club brings families together around stories that inspire kindness, giving, and biblical values.</p><h3 data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"481\" id=\"isPasted\">• Product Description:</h3><p data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"851\">The <strong data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"515\">Generous Family Book Club</strong> is a monthly subscription box designed for kids ages 4–10. Each box includes a beautifully illustrated children’s book focused on generosity, collectible stickers and cards, coloring sheets, digital animations, and parent-guided discussion tools. Every piece is designed to spark meaningful conversations and actions around generosity.</p><h3 data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"893\" id=\"isPasted\">• USP (Unique Selling Point):</h3><ul data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"1168\"><li data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"945\"><p data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"945\">Faith-based content centered on biblical values</p></li><li data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"984\"><p data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"984\">Encourages whole-family engagement</p></li><li data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1035\"><p data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1035\">Monthly themes that build a generosity mindset</p></li><li data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1101\"><p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1101\">Engaging add-ons: stickers, cards, animations, and activities</p></li><li data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1168\"><p data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1168\">Backed by a movement to equip parents, not just entertain kids</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1197\" id=\"isPasted\">&nbsp;Payment Terms:</h3><ul data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1399\"><li data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1269\"><p data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1269\"><strong data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1214\">Commission</strong>: 15%&nbsp;</p></li><li data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1302\"><p data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1302\"><strong data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1291\">Cookie Duration</strong>: 30 days</p></li><li data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1399\"><p data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1399\"><strong data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1325\">Payment Schedule</strong>: Paid out monthly via paypal on the first of the. month</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1432\" id=\"isPasted\">• Other Information:</h3><ul data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1717\"><li data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1527\"><p data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1527\">Perfect for Christian influencers, homeschool communities, parent bloggers, and ministries</p></li><li data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1582\"><p data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1582\">Bonus opportunities for high-performing affiliates</p></li><li data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1648\"><p data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1648\">Marketing assets provided (images, banners, swipe copy, etc.)</p></li><li data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1717\"><p data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1717\">Subscription is family-friendly, faith-forward, and kid-approved</p></li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br></p></div></div>",
